lgn="just"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPts val="1400"/></a:lnSpc></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1000" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="000000"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Poppins Light Bold"/><a:ea typeface="Poppins Light Bold"/><a:cs typeface="Poppins Light Bold"/><a:sym typeface="Poppins Light Bold"/></a:rPr><a:t>Sandeep Sandha, the visionary Founder and CEO of Sandha &amp; Company, is a dynamic leader committed to promote innovation, quality, and sustainable growth. Thanks to his strategic guidance, the company has become a reputable name in the industry, renowned for its customer-centric approach and technological expertise.</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr algn="just"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPts val="1400"/></a:lnSpc></a:pPr><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="1000" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="000000"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Poppins Light Bold"/><a:ea typeface="Poppins Light Bold"/><a:cs typeface="Poppins Light Bold"/><a:sym typeface="Poppins Light Bold"/></a:endParaRPr></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="0" lvl="0" indent="0" algn="just"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPts val="1400"/></a:lnSpc></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1000" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="000000"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Poppins Light Bold"/><a:ea typeface="Poppins Light Bold"/><a:cs typeface="Poppins Light Bold"/><a:sym typeface="Poppins Light Bold"/></a:rPr><a:t>With sharp business acumen and a deep understanding of market trends, Mr. Sandha has been instrumental in defining the company’s long-term vision, steering it towards becoming a progressive enterprise. His leadership prioritizes operational excellence, talent development, and value creation for all stakeholders.</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="0" lvl="0" indent="0" algn="just"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPts val="1400"/></a:lnSpc></a:pPr><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="1000" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="000000"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Poppins Light Bold"/><a:ea typeface="Poppins Light Bold"/><a:cs typeface="Poppins L